      "title": "MPTCP: Improve meta token handling",
      "message": "MPTCP: Improve meta token handling\n\nDon't assert if an existing MPTCP flow doesn't have a token.  It's possible to generate traffic with that condition, so it's not a dissector logic issue\n\nRelated to #17890 case 15\n",
