      "title": "NBAP: Remove DISSECTOR_ASSERT",
      "message": "NBAP: Remove DISSECTOR_ASSERT\n\nIt's possible to create a packet that hits the assert, which is not a dissector logic bug, so update the code to just range check values, but otherwise silently ignore.\n\nRelated to #17890 case 27\n",
